# --- TEMPORARY: the retail bring-up set (committed 2026-08-31, to be replaced) ---
# These are RETAIL Joint Operations bytes: the player body + anims, the avatar
# combo, the first-person rifle, the default infantry clip set and their
# textures -- the bring-up set README.md describes. Committed by explicit
# decision so the minimal set runs (and ships) from a fresh checkout; every
# line is deleted as our own writer-produced replacement lands (the 3di
# builder exists; the .bad writer is still parse-only). Names stay
# individually listed on purpose: removing one is the same conscious call
# as adding one.
